# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for CUDA idioms in the test programs that the
# nvcc-compatible driver builds in sanitizer builds (tests/CMakeLists.txt).
#
# rt_api.cu: a kernel spins on a volatile flag in pinned host memory that
# the host sets later (host-to-kernel signal, as CUDA programs write it).
# volatile is not synchronisation in C++, so ThreadSanitizer reports it.
race:test_streams_and_events
